// The salamander's three styles (scripts/hunter_salamander.rs2), in the combat tab's order:
//   Scorch - Aggressive, slash, Strength (and Hitpoints) experience, +3 Strength
//   Flare  - "Accurate", ranged, Ranged experience - but, as OSRS's wiki and Mod Ash have it, a rapid
//            style in all but name: no invisible Ranged boost, and one tick quicker (4, not 5)
//   Blaze  - Defensive, magic, Magic experience at half a spell's rate (2 per damage), +3 Defence
// ^style_ranged_rapid and ^style_magic_normal are the damagestyles with exactly that experience and
// those invisible boosts (Blaze's +3 Defence is added in ~player_combat_stat). The chinchompas' fuses
// are weapon_thrown_table's Accurate, Rapid and Longrange - they are thrown weapons.
[weapon_salamander_table]
table=combat_style_table
data=damagestyle,^style_melee_aggressive
data=damagestyle,^style_ranged_rapid
data=damagestyle,^style_magic_normal
data=damagetype,^slash_style
data=damagetype,^ranged_style
data=damagetype,^magic_style
